---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="關於"
  titleEn="About"
  description="一個由站主管理、清楚分隔公開與私人內容的個人發佈空間。"
  descriptionEn="An owner-managed publishing space with explicit public and private boundaries."
>
  <div class="page-stack about-page">
    <header class="route-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">Personal Space</p>
      <h1>安靜、清楚的發佈空間 <small lang="en">About</small></h1>
      <p>
        Personal Space
        用來發佈筆記、文章及經審閱的來源整理，讓內容可以按時間、主題與關鍵字重新找到。
      </p>
      <p class="en-subline" lang="en">
        A focused home for Notes, Articles, and reviewed source Editions,
        designed for calm reading and durable discovery.
      </p>
      <div class="button-row">
        <a class="button button--primary" href="/stream">
          閱讀最新內容 <span lang="en">Open Stream</span>
        </a>
        <a class="button" href="/search">
          搜尋與主題 <span lang="en">Search</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="about-grid" aria-label="產品原則 Product principles">
      <article>
        <span aria-hidden="true">01</span>
        <h2>公開邊界 <small lang="en">Public by decision</small></h2>
        <p>
          只有明確發佈及設定為公開的內容會進入公開頁、搜尋、RSS 與
          sitemap。草稿、私人及未列出內容不會被公開索引。
        </p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span aria-hidden="true">02</span>
        <h2>有限閱讀 <small lang="en">Finite reading</small></h2>
        <p>
          動態按時間排列，不設互動數字或演算法推薦；封存、分類與標籤提供穩定的返回路徑。
        </p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span aria-hidden="true">03</span>
        <h2>來源清楚 <small lang="en">Source-aware</small></h2>
        <p>
          Edition
          只在站主審閱後公開，保留短摘錄、來源名稱及原文連結；內容與權利仍以原發布者為準。
        </p>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="about-system">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">系統方式 · How it works</p>
        <h2>簡單而可驗證</h2>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p>
          網站以 Astro 及 Cloudflare Workers 運行，公開文章資料存於
          D1，經驗證的圖片存於 R2。私人 Studio 由 Cloudflare Access
          與應用程式身分核對共同保護。
        </p>
        <p lang="en">
          Built with Astro and Cloudflare Workers, with D1 for publishing data,
          R2 for validated images, and an owner-only Studio protected at both
          the Access and application layers.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-2);
    color: var(--space-teal-strong);
    font-size: var(--font-size--1);
    font-weight: 760;
  }
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    border-top: 1px solid var(--space-border-strong);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--space-border-strong);
  }
  .about-grid article {
    position: relative;
    min-width: 0;
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
  }
  .about-grid article + article {
    border-left: 1px solid var(--space-border);
  }
  .about-grid article > span {
    color: var(--space-border-strong);
    font-size: var(--font-size-3);
    font-weight: 800;
  }
  .about-grid h2 {
    margin: var(--space-4) 0 0;
    font-size: var(--font-size-2);
  }
  .about-grid h2 small {
    display: block;
    margin-top: var(--space-1);
    color: var(--space-primary);
    font-size: 0.55em;
  }
  .about-grid p,
  .about-system p {
    color: var(--space-ink-muted);
  }
  .about-system {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(12rem, 0.7fr) minmax(0, 1.3fr);
    gap: var(--space-7);
    padding: clamp(1.75rem, 5vw, 3.5rem) var(--page-gutter);
    background: linear-gradient(
      135deg,
      var(--space-surface-blue),
      var(--space-surface-yellow)
    );
  }
  .about-system h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--font-size-3);
  }
  .about-system p:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  @media (max-width: 47.99rem) {
    .about-grid,
    .about-system {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .about-grid article + article {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--space-border);
      border-left: 0;
    }
    .about-system {
      gap: var(--space-3);
    }
  }
</style>
